OL,5,G1300 1066: A Year to Conquer England
OL,6,G     with Dan Snow
OL,7,     FAfter King Harold's brother Tostig
OL,8,     Fattacks the south coast, another
OL,9,     Fenemy strikes when a Viking force
OL,10,     Flands in the north. Harold must
OL,11,     Ffight for his kingdom - and life.
OL,12,G1400 1066: A Year to Conquer England
OL,13,G     with Dan Snow
OL,14,     FAfter months trapped in a port in
OL,15,     FFrance, Duke William leads his
OL,16,     Finvasion fleet across the Channel
OL,17,     F- but King Harold is 300 miles
OL,18,     Faway, having defeated the Vikings.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/8
